                "text": "Diabetes is one of the top ten causes of death in the U.S. During #NationalDiabetes Month, we recommit ourselves to raising awareness & support for those affected by diabetes.\n\nAs Co-Chair of the Diabetes Caucus, I will continue fighting for accessible treatment options & a cure.",
