                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It's #NationalDiabetesMonth! As Diabetes Caucus co-chair & a mom to someone with diabetes, I\u2019m working to ensure everyone w/ diabetes can access the care & treatment they need. We must lower insulin costs for ALL Americans & work towards a cure so everyone can live healthy lives.",
