                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today is #WorldDiabetesDay!\n\nTwo years ago, I proudly helped pass the Inflation Reduction Act, capping insulin costs at $35 per month for millions of seniors. As Diabetes Caucus co-chair, I will keep working to ensure affordable diabetes care & treatment for every patient.",
