                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "My thoughts are with President Biden, Dr. Biden and the entire Biden family following the president\u2019s cancer diagnosis.\n\nI know President Biden is a fighter, and I\u2019m praying for his health and a swift recovery.",
