                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Someone you love is alive today because of an NIH-funded breakthrough \u2014 a cancer therapy, a diabetes treatment, an affordable drug developed in a small lab somewhere across our country.\n\nTrump\u2019s anti-science agenda is stealing that future from families. Cutting NIH doesn\u2019t save money. It costs lives.\n\nWe were the gold standard in research. Now those researchers and biomedical companies will go elsewhere, including China.  \n\nhttps://t.co/DX07qGEo2Z",
                "text_lang": "en",
